[00:00.560]Lesson 31. | 第31课。
[00:04.420]Where's Sally, Jack? | 萨利在哪儿，杰克？
[00:07.130]She's in the garden /ˈɡɑːdn/, Jean. | 她在花园里，吉恩。
[00:10.270]What is she doing? | 她在干什么？
[00:12.200]She's sitting under the tree /triː/. | 她坐在树下。
[00:15.110]Is Tim in the garden /ˈɡɑːdn/ too? | 蒂姆也在花园里吗？
[00:18.060]Yes, he is. | 是的，他在。
[00:19.780]He's climbing /ˈklaɪmɪŋ/ the tree /triː/. | 他正在爬树。
[00:22.560]I beg your pardon? | 请再说一遍。
[00:24.490]Who is climbing /ˈklaɪmɪŋ/ the tree /triː/? | 谁在爬树？
[00:26.790]Tim is. | 蒂姆在爬。
[00:28.980]What about the dog? | 狗呢？
[00:30.700]The dog's in the garden /ˈɡɑːdn/ too. | 狗也在花园里。
[00:33.720]It's running /ˈrʌnɪŋ/ across the grass /ɡrɑːs/. | 它正在草地上奔跑。
[00:36.560]It's running /ˈrʌnɪŋ/ after a cat /kæt/. | 它正在追一只猫。
